  "description": "The Double Peak Comp Plus features a lightweight 6000 series alloy boost frame with internal head tube, a Vaxa Boost suspension fork with thru-axle and 120mm of travel, and oversized Kenda Havoc 27.5 x 2.6\" Plus tires for an ultra compliant ride. The \"DP\" Comp Plus features a Shimano Deore 10 speed drive train with a FSA Comet 1X Boost crankset equipped with a 30-tooth chainring, and a new Shimano M201 Hydraulic disc brakeset. The wider Plus size tires provide a sure footed and comfortable ride, which make the \"DP\" Plus Comp the perfect companion for fun rides and trail adventures.\nNew Double Peak 27.5\" Plus X6 alloy Boost frame w/ internal routing\nHL Vaxa 868 HLO 27.5\" Plus Boost fork, 120mm travel, Mag lowers & thru-axle\nFSA Comet Modular 1x Boost crankset, 30T Crmo Chainring\nShimano Deore 6000 rear derailleur & shifter\nShimano Deore 10-spd 11-42T cassette\nShimano Hubs, thru-axle front, Center Lock\nPivit alloy Light, 20mm riser handlebar\nWTB Werewolf grips and Volt Sport saddle\nXD-127 Disc alloy DW, 32mm wide rims\nNew Shimano MT-201 hydraulic disc brakeset. Center Lock\nNew Kenda Havoc 27.5x2.6\" tires",
